    "language": "got",
    "text": "jus auk galeikondans waurþuþ, broþrjus, aikklesjom gudis þaim wisandeim in Iudaia in Xristau Iesu, unte þata samo wunnuþ jah jus fram izwaraim inkunjam swaswe jah weis fram Iudaium,",
