    "canonical_ref": "1Thess.2.15",
    "language": "got",
    "text": "þaiei jah fraujin usqemun Iesua jah swesaim praufetum jah uns frawrekun jah guda ni galeikandans jah allaim mannam andaneiþans sind,",
