    "canonical_ref": "1Thess.3.5",
    "language": "got",
    "text": "duþþe jah ik ju ni usþulan insandida du ufkunnan galaubein izwara, ibai aufto usfaifraisi izwis sa fraisands jah sware wairþai arbaiþs unsara.",
