    "language": "got",
    "text": "aþþan nu at qimandin Teimauþaiu at unsis fram izwis jah gateihandin uns galaubein jah friaþwa izwara, jah þatei gaminþi unsar habaiþ god sinteino, gairnjandans uns gasaiƕan, swaswe jah weis izwis,",
